  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The phantom thief is proficient with all simple weapons, plus the hand crossbow, rapier, shortbow, and short sword. They are proficient in light armor, but not shields. A phantom thief can cast phantom thief spells while wearing light armor and using a shield without incurring the normal arcane spell failure chance. Like any other arcane spellcaster, a phantom thief wearing medium or heavy armor incurs a chance of arcane spell failure if the spell in question has a somatic component.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/phantom-thief#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
